Laurent Toutain said:

@Martine great job, do you have some results on compression ratio ?

No, performance measurements wasn't the goal of the work, I implemented it for (see my other mail to the mailing list; or my talk from iotops ;-)). But at least for DTLSv1.2 I should be able to generate some statistics from some of my traces. For DTLSv1.3 some back of the envelop calculations should suffice (for DTLSv1.2 probably too). The implementation was based on https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10051055. It has some numbers, but the ruleset there is unnecessarily rigid IMHO.
